# Test http requests for my api

### Get server root
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get not found 404
GET http://localhost:3000/something-not-found

### Get all items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

### Get an item by id (existing)
GET http://localhost:3000/items/1

### Get an item by id (not found - 404 test)
GET http://localhost:3000/items/99

### Get a random Chuck Norris joke
GET http://localhost:3000/joke

### Post new item
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "postattu itemi"
}

### Modify existing item by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/1
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "uusi päivitetty nimi"
}

### Modify item with invalid id (404 test)
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/99
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "ei onnistu"
}

### Delete item by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/2

### Delete item with invalid id (404 test)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/99